colibrì
  https://github.com/JustVugg/colibri
  Copyright 2026 Vincenzo Fornaro. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
  The GLM-5.2 engine (web/glm/, tools/glm_*.py) uses colibrì's technique, which
  keeps the dense part of a mixture-of-experts model resident and streams the
  routed experts from disk. It also reads colibrì's int4/int8 container format
  and its .coli_usage routing history, for interoperability. The code here is
  an independent WebGPU and NumPy implementation; no colibrì source is included.

