Models and data
  The main branch contains no model weights or data sets. The tools fetch them
  from their publishers. The `data` branch holds prebuilt data sets converted
  from these models; each of its folders carries the model's licence (LICENSE)
  and a statement of what was changed (NOTICE). Each model comes under its own
  licence, which the viewer shows:
  - GPT-2: OpenAI, MIT License.
  - DistilGPT2: Hugging Face, Apache License 2.0.
  - MDLM: Sahoo et al., Kuleshov Group, Cornell, Apache License 2.0.
  - GLM-5.2: Z.ai, MIT License.
  - GPT-2 sparse autoencoders: Joseph Bloom, MIT License. Feature descriptions
    are fetched live from Neuronpedia (https://www.neuronpedia.org).
  - Jina-CLIP-v2: Jina AI, CC BY-NC 4.0. It produced the vectors of the
    KnowDrive store data set.

